      "label": "Note · 04.05.26 · 44 w",
      "text": "Npc guy: did you hear about the Current Thing? Normie: I love my dog me: I’m the Main Character! I’m the only one who can think (I try to get out of the stocks but someone throws another tomato which burns my eyes again)",
